alm the Wu Dynasty saw to officially submit themselves as subjects of Bianfang in an effort to maintain themselves to any semblance of power. \n\nThe Kingdom of Xiyun would come to an end when in 1521 their overlord Bianfang was invaded by [[The Command]], due to the required commitment to defend themselves from the hobgoblins Xiyun was left undefended. Louyip and Feiten took this opportunity to take over what remained of the realm, putting an end to it in 1523."}]},"dateStatus":"source-text-year","geometryNote":"仅增资料与版本判断，不修改地图、省级归属或宗属链。","originRecordId":"manual:hle26-ys-xiyun-end-1523","originBatchId":"manual:hle26-integrated","researchPublication":{"manifestPath":"docs/research/haless-map-20260921/publications/haless-library-expansion-20260921-integrated-batch-publication.json","manifestSha256":"f0fb62914378a541f56fe03b96f42ed7a59fbdbeee2936fac01c25c8244979bc","batchPath":"docs/research/haless-map-20260921/publications/haless-library-expansion-20260921-integrated-batch-input.json","batchSha256":"466b6b250ac590d24e8ed8756c8d70e5eb8c7b3cb9ca62278934485c54ec4940","mapActorIds":["Y21","Y20","Y24","v3:Y06"],"publishEvent":true}},{"id":"hlm26-bc-ys-xiyun-luoyip-1523","year":1523,"title":"西云残部并入Luoyip的边界回推（反向推演）","description":"1523王国终结有正文，Luoyip与Feiten分界未给。现1820四省均指Luoyip，优先2个较可靠对应；另外2个弱边界单列可选，不借端点证明精确割地。","kind":"hypothesis","stepId":"hlm26-bc-ys-xiyun-luoyip-1523","sourceIds":["manual:hle26-ys-wiki-6269-33098","endpoint-1820-eu4","alignment-reasoning-yanshen-south-backcast"],"dateEvidence":{"exactYear":null,"earliest":1521,"latest":1523,"chosenYear":1523,"dateIsHistoricalFact":false,"precision":"source-window-and-endpoint-constrained-display-hypothesis","upperBoundIsHistoricalFact":false,"qualification":"Window and selected display year do not establish a dated conquest, treaty, foundation or border."},"geometryNote":"endpoint-constrained-regional-inference; immutable EU4 polygons; source political scope plus reviewed original-owner envelope or fixed1820 corresponde