州解放战争","description":"协约趁Jadd战争进攻魔军，截至1614已有初期进展；Dragon收复Jiangdu，1617围攻Tianlou失败。战后魔军保持Jiangdu西北平原及Balrijin但失去Tianhu东南部分地区。Zyujyut未参与协约攻势，不以成员名单推全员参战。","kind":"context","sourceIds":["manual:bwclose26-jadd-wiki-30147","manual:hl26-core-doc-8df803f7acee","manual:hl26-core-unified-haless-918310f82183"],"sourceUrl":"https://anbennar.fandom.com/wiki/The_Command?oldid=30147","sourceTitle":"The Command","mapAction":"none","dateEvidence":{"status":"explicit-source-date","locator":"Command Yanshen //w:p[21]; Unified body/p[572]","note":"year为来源标示的事件或区间起年；正文保留战争跨度。Google原件当前快照的修订与批准状态未确认。"},"dateStatus":"source-interval","geometryNote":"仅文本；地名与战争范围不等于EU4省级归属变化。","originRecordId":"manual:hl26-cr-yanshen-war-1613","originBatchId":"manual:hl26-integrated","researchPublication":{"manifestPath":"docs/research/haless-map-20260921/publications/haless-library-20260921-integrated-batch-publication.json","manifestSha256":"a0d897ad645ad22ee35e296ebf6c068dbbf46ebaa69e7fb79f843477341f98dd","batchPath":"docs/research/haless-map-20260921/publications/haless-library-20260921-integrated-batch-input.json","batchSha256":"26401307b8e180dfaee63ecab6a726c6fae7c258b3fc0a63669580de86364fb6","mapActorIds":["R62","R69","Y19","Y20","Y24","Y26","Y13","Y85"],"publishEvent":true}},{"id":"ca09-text-hl26-cr-yanshen-war-1646","year":1646,"endYear":1662,"title":"1646—1662年：Tianlou战争","description":"魔军于1650首次围城后撤兵，1655再围；1658Tianlou陷落，同期结束对Feiten的围攻并巩固所得。战争持续至1662，在烟州南部进展有限。1656—1658 Feiten救援属于同一战役，避免重复建史。","kind":"context","sourceIds":["manual:bwclose26-jadd-wiki-30147","manual:hl26-core-doc-8df803f7acee","manual:hl26-core-unified-haless-918310f82183"],"sourceUrl":"https://anbennar.fandom.com/wiki/The_Command?oldid=30147","sourceTitle":"The Command","mapAction":"none","dateEvidence":{"status":"explicit-source-date","locator":"Command Yanshen //w:p[26]; Unified body/p[601]","note":"year为来源标示的事件或区间起年；正文保留战争跨度。Google原件当前快照的修订与批准状态未确认。"},"dateStatus":"source-interval","geometryNote":"仅文本；地名与战争范围不等于EU4省级归属变化。","or