n":"固定Wiki叙述1697完成Mk5，1698在Feiten卸货并遇抗议，1701运抵Luoyip神庙并钻开入口。内部陷阱和狭窄通道继续拖延；此时并无整个神庙立刻清空、毁灭或政权更替的结论。本文沿同一Gommo年表稿系，作为可审查来源叙述。","kind":"context","sourceIds":["manual:hld26-ys-wiki-3308-20217"],"sourceUrl":"https://anbennar.fandom.com/wiki/Korashi_Drill?oldid=20217","sourceTitle":"Anbennar Wiki: Korashi Drill","mapAction":"none","dateEvidence":{"exactYear":null,"sourceStartYear":1697,"sourceEndYear":1701,"precision":"source-explicit-sequence","dateIsHistoricalFact":false,"sourceIds":["manual:hld26-ys-wiki-3308-20217"]},"dateStatus":"source-interval","geometryNote":"Textual assertion only; actor/place names do not establish a complete province transfer or boundary.","originRecordId":"manual:hld26-ys-korashi-drill-mk5-luoyip-1697","originBatchId":"manual:hld26-integrated","researchPublication":{"manifestPath":"docs/research/haless-map-20260921/publications/haless-deep-research-20260921-integrated-batch-publication.json","manifestSha256":"61659cb4f4838e347c2d3300997362a0cd676c7c1dba7cd4983004ea214e6215","batchPath":"docs/research/haless-map-20260921/publications/haless-deep-research-20260921-integrated-batch-input.json","batchSha256":"bd18d6a8d8b3bf8007730b4c0ff0a69e5608ad29c64e49a2c0c82b57aa9dc93c","mapActorIds":["Y19","Y20","Y24","v3:Y03","v3:Y05","v3:Y06"],"publishEvent":true}},{"id":"ca09-text-hl26-cr-yanshen-war-1707","year":1707,"endYear":1718,"title":"1707—1718年：第二次烟州解放战争","description":"1706—1718大起义削弱东部军团；1707协约正式再战，Shuuvuush、Tianlou、Feiten、Yinquan协同，截至1715已将魔军推至Jiangdu，1718疲于战争形成该线。起义起年1706与战争起年1707分开。","kind":"context","sourceIds":["manual:bwclose26-jadd-wiki-30147","manual:hl26-core-doc-8df803f7acee","manual:hl26-core-unified-haless-918310f82183"],"sourceUrl":"https://anbennar.fandom.com/wiki/The_Command?oldid=30147","sourceTitle":"The Command","mapAction":"none","dateEvidence":{"status":"explicit-source-date","locator":"Command Yanshen //w:p[34,35]; Unified body/p[662,664]","note":"year为来源标示的事件或区间起年；正文保留战争跨度。Google原件当前快照的修订与批准状态未确认。"},"dateStatus":"source-interval","geometryNote":"仅文本；地名与战争范围不等于EU4省级归属变化。","originRecordId":"manual:hl26-cr-yanshen-war-1707","originBatchId":"manual:hl26-integrated","researchPublication":{"manifestPath":"docs/research/haless-map-20260921/publications/haless-library-20260921-integrated-batch-publication.json","manifestSha256":"a0d897ad645ad22ee35e296ebf6c068dbbf46ebaa69e7fb79f843477341f98dd","batchPath":"docs/research/haless-map-20260921/publications/haless-library-20260921-integrated-batch-input.json","batchSha256":"26401307b8e180dfaee63ecab6a726c6fae7c258b3fc0a63669580de86364fb6","mapActorIds":["R62","R69","Y19","Y20","Y26","Y24"],"publishEvent":true}},{"id":"ca09-text-hl26-cr-yanshen-war-1734","year":1734,"endYear":1751,"title":"1734—1751年：第三次烟州解放战争","description":"协约于1734进攻，围攻Jiangdu五年至1739陷落；1742 Wuhyun起义帮助魔军收复，1744 Tianlou城门之战后Noriko继任，1745转攻北方。1751 Shengdao谈判期间寺庙被盗，Rending爆发；Rending本身由共享主题负责，战争不另造同名Rending事件。","kind":"context","sourceIds":["manual:bwclose26-jadd-wiki-30147","manual:hl26-core-doc-8df803f7acee","manual:hl26-core-unified-haless-918310f82183"],"sourceUrl":"https://anbennar.fandom.com/wiki/The_Command?oldid=30147","sourceTitle":"The Command","mapAction":"none","dateEvidence":{"status":"explicit-source-date","locator":"Command Yanshen //w:p[42]; Unified body/p[682]","note":"year为来源标示的事件或区间起年；正文保留战争跨度。Google原件当前快照的修订与批准状态未确认。"},"dateStatus":"source-interval","geometryNote":"仅文本；地名与战争范围不等于EU4省级归属变化。","originRecordId":"manual:hl26-cr-yanshen-war-1734","originBatchId":"manual:hl26-integrated","researchPublication":{"manifestPath":"docs/research/haless-map-20260921/publications/haless-library-20260921-integrated-batch-publication.json","manifestSha256":"a0d897ad645ad22ee35e296ebf6c068dbbf46ebaa69e7fb79f843477341f98dd","batchPath":"docs/research/haless-map-20260921/publications/haless-library-20260921-integrated-batch-input.json","batchSha256":"26401307b8e180dfaee63ecab6a726c6fae7c258b3fc0a63669580de86364fb6","mapActorIds":["R62","R69","Y19","Y20","Y24","Y26"],"publishEvent":true}